{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":90312,\"title\":\"Kaafir\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Amid a sprawling border of our country, begins the journey of a young Pakistani mother who comes into India through strange series of circumstances and is unable to go back home. The series revolves around the relationship between this accused militant and her lawyer who makes her justice, his mission. Will his mission and her dream ever come true?\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tRlmx7Mym09HZHkeD7XiDFpZeK6.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jNFCTs7TK9GsBGZkXhOOavA1HUf.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.4,\"voteCount\":7,\"year\":2019,\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":8,\"createdBy\":[\"Sonam Nair\",\"Bhavani Iyer\"],\"networks\":[\"ZEE5\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IN\",\"name\":\"India\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2019-06-15\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1170860,\"name\":\"Sonam Nair\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2125272,\"name\":\"Abhiroy Singh\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":85669,\"name\":\"Dia Mirza\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oJSZlMkIGC1Yr8QxdBLliUjPRSd.jpg\"},{\"id\":1255557,\"name\":\"Mohit Raina\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mPQ68Zweqt8HC6tI9tQ8i3KW3g9.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"98cJOl-vZG4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"N9NDGsaoqjk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ml9FVjapfw8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kd9OCPIIeiKCn9y3gXcfkETjfqb.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2019-06-15\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"The First Meeting\",\"overview\":\"Vedant meets Seher, the daughter of Kainaaz Akthar, a Pakistani woman jailed in India. But, Vedant is in a state of shock after meeting Kainaaz.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tkqnnaEKf2vJCUB2rwNbucjh127.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-15\",\"runtime\":32},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"A Tale of Retrospection\",\"overview\":\"Vedant decides to help Kainaaz. But the situation gets tricky when no lawyer agrees to fight this controversial case in court.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ogtPED2rdk0NCobhHjdsLV58Ulg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-15\",\"runtime\":39},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Truth and Lies\",\"overview\":\"Vedant discovers an unspoken truth about Kainaaz while preparing for her case. Will he make the same mistake again that left his family traumatised seven years ago?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w1Dvn1nGE2CAwa4PNPi3IirdejG.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-15\",\"runtime\":32},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Judgement Day\",\"overview\":\"On learning about Seher being a child born of rape, Vedant mistakenly uses it to make his point in the court. How will this revelation impact Kainaaz's case?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sAcz6INMH5hwqORPoWi09QfLPQK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-15\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Redemption and Retribution\",\"overview\":\"Kainaaz blames Vedant for her misery and questions his intentions behind helping her. The court rules in her favour. But, she has a few more hurdles to cross.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o2jBdhTEJIYnNN30mJSvqQHOge1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-15\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Where Do We Belong?\",\"overview\":\"Vedant prepares to send Kainaaz and Seher back to their country. He gives Kainaaz the hope she needs to restart her life. But fate has something else planned for her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7j4eJHhMrsRSM9PoyjBjEBRoU3y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-15\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"A Final Try\",\"overview\":\"Vedant rushes to the hospital as his father collapses. Kainaaz and Seher go back to Dhruv's place, where some young men push them into the house and set it on fire.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mv1FEhu0x2Tm32dOoJ7HS7Maaj3.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-15\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The Last Goodbye\",\"overview\":\"Kainaaz's heart lies in India, but her duties call her back to Pakistan. And so begins her bittersweet journey with the memories of unfulfilled love.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4I6XvgehoS8kaKFTiIijCyog1nv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-06-15\",\"runtime\":54}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-06-15\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}